=======================================================
dudect Constant-Time Verification Suite
AMA Cryptography
=======================================================

Methodology: Welch's t-test on execution times
Threshold:   |t| < 5.0 (99.999% confidence)
Measurements: 100000 per test, up to 3 rounds
Timeout:     600 seconds (whole run)

